achievement: april_coalition

We have enough votes to form an "April Coalition" government consisting of the <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span>, <span style="color: #FF7F00;">**CSRP**</span> and <span style="color: #E0B0FF;">**RDP**</span> parties! This hasn’t been possible since the 1980’, and is expected to strengthen the reformist wing in our party. However, the exclusion of the <span style="color: #BE3075;">**LSPD**</span> has shifted them to the right, making future collaboration more tricky.

Who should be the chancellor?

- @scholz

@scholz
